{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c6fb3d04f1ea2fac56b371047970e179d8d5d2af756f8a0f332f23bed4bc1498", "ja": "（桃子のステージが終わった。まるでおもちゃ箱を\nひっくり返したような、にぎやかなステージだったな）", "zh": "（桃子的表演结束了。就好像是把玩具箱\n给翻过来一样，是场活泼的表演。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "0aa4830e700ef674f4cc196a95e2732d478f4380b691db44271c3acaedea1f67", "ja": "お兄ちゃん！\nどう？　桃子のステージ、すごかったでしょ？", "zh": "大哥哥！\n怎么样？桃子的表演很棒吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f1bc4726205259586f7240f635a611e4a6750bb1defb267d2ce8578039614fae", "ja": "ああ！　さすが、桃子はプロだな。\n立派にアイドルしていたよ。", "zh": "是啊！桃子真是非常专业。\n是个很出色的偶像喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "473c3c8dc2275d606a1b8a9bd6719b7f5a1fc0637ea2aeb00f0d6471a6f5bda9", "ja": "もう、何言ってるの？　お兄ちゃん。\n桃子は最初からプロだよ。", "zh": "真是的，大哥哥你在说什么啊？\n桃子本来就是专业的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c21115b86a48bb9c835ebdfb69e75d4d5a65273515992d1d3e0faed5b19ed6e3", "ja": "もちろん、子役……女優としてはな。\nでもアイドルとしては、ここからだぞ！", "zh": "那当然，不过那是就一个童星……一个演员而言。\n桃子的偶像之路还很漫长呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "52ccd4127b4b8322dadae44183e60b29cb8e8bef98f384bd66c8298f23bdc1c4", "ja": "え、なにそれ……\n桃子は、まだまだってこと？", "zh": "咦？什么意思……\n你是说桃子还差得很远吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d8f8dad73f5872682ba698b7efbcde4fa46ebfb18eb750ad6385c2408440d589", "ja": "そうだな。桃子はまだ、未完成だと思うよ。", "zh": "对啊，我觉得桃子还尚未完成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "5ca029e359cf0447ad78d10ac8d145433e0bb28d9891746ec9b65aac6cacd264", "ja": "な、なによ……お兄ちゃんのくせに、ナマイキ……！\nそれなら、桃子のどこがダメか言ってみて！", "zh": "什、什么嘛……大哥哥竟敢这么嚣张……！\n既然这样，你说说看桃子哪里不行啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "791b8d54b6db12e108f71d5cbad8ba80028fc09fdd02f65ebce388778e15fdd7", "ja": "も、桃子に、悪いところがあるなら……そういうの、\nちゃんと直すもん……桃子は、プロなんだし……。", "zh": "如、如果说桃子真的有缺点……\n桃子会努力改善的……因为桃子是专业的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8c178becf91013adb90533b4f5ab0cd54b60af6b9da87826ba9fda64adcf340e", "ja": "え？　ああいや、どこがダメとかじゃない。\nすまない、言い方が悪かったな。", "zh": "咦？不不不，你误会了，我不是在批评你。\n抱歉，我讲得不太清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1010_p", "source_sha256": "31f15e1231e917e5272c118580f01be72396413ccf246c3938a1c2b0dab091cf", "ja": "未完成っていうのは、未熟って意味じゃない。\n桃子は、まだまだ伸びるって言いたかったんだ。", "zh": "我说的尚未完成，并不是说你太过生涩。\n桃子，我的意思是你的未来还很宽广。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "0daca1840e2605094448c9e480943ee48ad83b56d05a78ebf334523650be6dd2", "ja": "ふ、ふ～ん……？　それってつまり、\n桃子はもっともっと、すごいアイドルになるってこと？", "zh": "是、是喔……也就是说，\n桃子以后可以成为更棒、更厉害的偶像啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1012_p", "source_sha256": "35336d0acc3d710c3c6bbf86ae9ebe9048c2ea09099d942d91751bddd84a73ca", "ja": "そうだ！　桃子はこれから、もっともっとすごい\nアイドルになる！　俺がそう、保証するよ。", "zh": "没错！桃子，你以后会成为更棒、更厉害的偶像！\n我向你保证。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "25cc6ac816d5074313e8ce7e08f4f885d49c66ec7191d65e7228a6f8531938e1", "ja": "そ、そう……まあ、お兄ちゃんの言い分は\nわかったけど。……でも、やっぱりナマイキだよ！", "zh": "是、是吗……好吧，桃子明白大哥哥的意思了……\n不过，你还是太嚣张了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "6a4587ef0162b81853d7bcf4bd781a12343b7fbde80e8c9266fdad4cc25d6bfb", "ja": "桃子、ノド乾いちゃった。\nバツとして、ジュース買ってきて。", "zh": "桃子口渴了，\n就处罚你去买果汁吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c51f97b452e4fa41bff00a74c6033ede4796c2ff83c32b546ab3f44aa30bc2ce", "ja": "え……い、いきなりだな？", "zh": "什么……太、太突然了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "7c61ec937f633c10595b44080383a7e4b1e2673cfde17df1a37771ce636237bf", "ja": "ほら、グズグズしないの！　早く！！", "zh": "真是的，别拖拖拉拉的！快一点！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1017_p", "source_sha256": "cceb4600e288d7ace2bd83b6ef2202da8b6f218900f64539b8caf4c43b0f4646", "ja": "あ、ああ。わかったわかった……。", "zh": "好、好啦，我去买就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0054_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "2c4399d438e3b2306c1fd38c7248f27a3c4ff0a9d79a93f1bca3d2614bb3aa7b", "ja": "もっとすごいアイドル、か……。\nえへへ……♪", "zh": "能成为更棒的偶像吗……\n嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
